PDF Question Answering Chatbot using RAG

Developed a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) based chatbot to answer questions from PDF documents using Claude LLM and LangChain. The project allows users to upload PDFs and interact with the content through a simple Streamlit interface.

Technologies Used
Python
LangChain
Claude LLM
Streamlit
ChromaDB (Vector Database)
Project Workflow
Uploaded and processed PDF documents.
Extracted and split text into smaller chunks.
Generated embeddings for the text data.
Stored embeddings in ChromaDB for vector-based retrieval.
Used LangChain retrieval pipeline with Claude LLM to generate accurate answers from the PDF content.
Built an interactive UI using Streamlit.
AI Tool Usage

AI tools and online resources were used for learning concepts and understanding implementation details. The code was written and understood personally without directly copying complete implementations. Additional learning support was taken specifically for understanding ChromaDB vector storage concepts, as it was a new area of study.
